meta {
  name: S2 — A query without the right tenant returns nothing
  seq: 2
}

docs {
  TICK-44. The database wall is proven by `make isolation` (see the guide). Over HTTP the only tenant data route on `main` is `GET /api/v1/me`; these requests show that naming another tenant anywhere in the request changes nothing and never returns its data. Needs `tools/seed.sh`.
}
